---
const original = '/art/fx-original-decision-loop.png';
---
<figure class="fx-original-flow">
  <a class="diagram-image" href={original} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open the complete original FX decision loop image in a new tab">
    <img src={original} width="3057" height="2667" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Original FX decision loop: watch order progress and fill prices, assess schedule and benchmarks, then remain passive or intervene. The complete branches are transcribed below." />
  </a>
  <figcaption>Original design exploration · The decision loop · <a href="https://www.figma.com/design/17Rsi3vWFtaYwlrRf5iO8E/Interview-Presentation-2026?node-id=2068-1681" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View the Figma source<span class="vh"> (opens in a new tab)</span> ↗</a></figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .fx-original-flow { margin: 0; min-width: 0; }
  .diagram-image { display: block; width: 100%; padding: 0; border: 0; background: #111418; }
  .diagram-image :global(picture) { display: block; width: 100%; }
  .diagram-image :global(img) { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: none; aspect-ratio: auto 3057 / 2667; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 0; }
  figcaption { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--fg-2); }

  .flow-transcript ul { padding-left: 1.3em; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .flow-transcript li { display: list-item; padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; }
</style>
